"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Processes with a higher "
"priority will take priority for access to the hard disk.  Programs running "
"at the same <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Best Effort/Normal</span> "
"priority are served in a <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Round Robin</"
"span> fashion.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">উত্তম চেষ্ঠা সূচনা</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">এটা উচ্চ প্ৰথামিকতা থকা "
"প্ৰক্ৰিয়াসমূহ হাৰ্ড ডিস্কলে অভিগমৰ কাৰণে প্ৰাথমিকতা লব। একে <span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">উত্তম/সাধাৰন</span> প্ৰাথমিকতাত চলি থকা প্ৰগ্ৰামসমূহক এটা <span "
"style=\" font-weight:600;\">Round Robin</span> প্ৰক্ৰিয়াত</p></body></html> "
"পৰিৱেশন কৰা হয়।"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:343
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioBestEffort)
#: rc.cpp:180
msgid "Best effort"
msgstr "উত্তম চেষ্টা"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:353
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, radioRealTime)
#: rc.cpp:183
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Process gets immediate "
"access to the hard disk whenever needed, regardless of what else is going on."
"</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">প্ৰক্ৰিয়াৰ যেতিয়ায় প্ৰয়োজন "
"তেতিয়ায় হাৰ্ড ডিস্কলে তৎক্ষণাত অভিগম পায়, বেলেগ যিয়ে চলি নাথাকক।</p></body></"
"html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:360
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, radioRealTime)
#: rc.cpp:189
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Real Time Scheduling</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">The <span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Real Time</span> scheduling class is given first access to the "
"disk, regardless of what else is going on in the system. Thus the <span "
"style=\" font-weight:600;\">Real Time</span> class needs to be used with "
"some care, as it can starve other processes. As with the <span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Best Effort</span> class, 8 priority levels are defined "
"denoting how big a time slice a given process will receive on each "
"scheduling window.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">প্ৰকৃত সময় সূচনা</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"> <span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">প্ৰকৃত সময়</span> সূচনা ক্লাছক ডিস্কলে প্ৰথম অভিগম দিয়া হয়,  চিস্টেমত "
"কি চলি আছে তাৰ বিষয়ে চিন্তা নকৰি। সেয়েহে <span style=\" font-weight:600;"
"\">প্ৰকৃত সময়</span> ক্লাছক কিছু সাৱধানেৰে ব্যৱহাৰ কৰিব লাগিব, যিহেতু ই অন্য "
"প্ৰক্ৰিয়াসমূহক ক্ষতিগ্ৰস্থ কৰিব পাৰে।  যেনে <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">উত্তম "
"চেষ্ঠা</span> ক্লাছৰ লগত, ৮ টা প্ৰাথমিকতা স্তৰৰ বিৱৰণ দিয়া হয় এয়া নিৰ্ণয় কৰি যে "
"প্ৰতিটো সূচক উইন্ডোত এটা প্ৰদান কৰা প্ৰক্ৰিয়ায় কিমান ডাঙৰ সময় ছোৱা গ্ৰহন কৰিব।</p></"
"body></html>"

